<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>洁家家政 - 北京家庭保洁服务</title>
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
        }
        .container {
            max-width: 1440px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 20px;
        }
        header {
            background-color: #333;
            color: #fff;
            padding: 20px;
            text-align: center;
        }
        header h1 {
            margin: 0;
        }
        nav {
            background-color: #444;
            padding: 10px;
            text-align: center;
        }
        nav a {
            color: #fff;
            text-decoration: none;
            margin: 0 20px;
        }
        .hero {
            background-image: linear-gradient(to bottom, #f7f7f7, #fff);
            padding: 100px;
            text-align: center;
        }
        .hero h2 {
            font-size: 36px;
            margin: 20px 0;
        }
        .service {
            padding: 20px;
        }
        .service h3 {
            font-size: 24px;
            margin: 10px 0;
        }
        footer {
            background-color: #333;
            color: #fff;
            padding: 20px;
            text-align: center;
            clear: both;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <header>
        <h1>洁家家政</h1>
    </header>
    <nav>
        <a href="index.html">首页</a>
        <a href="service.html">服务项目</a>
        <a href="about.html">关于我们</a>
        <a href="reservation.html">预约服务</a>
    </nav>
    <div class="hero">
        <h2>专业家庭保洁服务，让您的家更洁净</h2>
        <p>洁家家政，北京领先的家庭保洁服务公司，为您提供定期和一次性保洁服务。</p>
        <button style="background-color: #4CAF50; color: #fff; padding: 10px 20px; border: none; border-radius: 5px; cursor: pointer;">立即预约</button>
    </div>
    <div class="container">
        <div class="service">
            <h3>我们的服务</h3>
            <p>我们提供各种保洁服务，包括家居清洁、深度清洁、家具保养等。</p>
        </div>
    </div>
    <footer>
        <p>&copy; 2023 洁家家政</p>
    </footer>
</body>
</html>

